                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A very interesting Rogue-like that has a Binding of Issac feel. Its pretty easy to get used to the controls. I liked the nightmarish, yet evily funny creatures and bosses. Gameplay is fun, killing monsters by leading them into traps and using items, which is a uniquely fresh idea. It does have a few bugs, like sometimes the mouse control would spaz out, and during some boss fights the screen would shake more then it should have. I certainly hope more is added, as it is a bit short. Overall great game, definately worth the money. I look forward to seeing more content.",
